# CHAROS build log

## 2026-09-05 — TC-Nest learning-machine refresh, compatibility phase

- Audited the live NixOS host before mutation.
- Confirmed the current 25.11 system configuration does not evaluate on the
  26.05 stable channel because upstream removed unmaintained `neofetch`.
- Replaced `neofetch` with maintained `fastfetch` in the isolated refresh
  branch. Live activation remains pending a clean 26.05 evaluation and build.
- Preserved the dirty live checkout; this work is isolated from its modified
  `vibedeck` submodule and two untracked backup scripts.

